{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213520","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213520","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1521352001:0":{"text":"망할 보칼리스인! 감히 우리 푸를 꾀어서 도망치려고 하다니!","source_cn":"该死的呼临人！你竟敢蛊惑芙跟你私奔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0147190D6A83A6F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521352002:0":{"text":"도망이라뇨...? 아니, 그, 그런 적 없습니다!","source_cn":"私奔……？我、我没有啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC67C34161AB5906C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521352003:0":{"text":"아버지, 마르코는 그런 짓 안 했어요!","source_cn":"阿爹，马尔科没做那样的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885F049DE1D48BC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521352004:0":{"text":"제발... 마르코를 해치지 마세요! 저희는 사랑하는 사이예요!","source_cn":"我……我不许你伤害他！我和他是真心相爱的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282D21DC9701CA21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521352005:0":{"text":"푸, 비켜라!","source_cn":"芙，你让开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6160589139A5F3D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521352006:1":{"text":"...아, 안 돼요!","source_cn":"——不！不可能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF31AB5493B0A0D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521352007:0":{"text":"물안개 영지가 점령당했을 때, 보칼리스인에게 괴롭힘을 당하던 트위스트이어를 도와준 게 바로 마르코였다고요!","source_cn":"水泽营地被占领的时候，有几个呼临人想欺负扭耳，是马尔科...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B26687938CE29A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521352008:0":{"text":"저와 트위스트이어 모두 사냥을 잘 못해서... 먹을 게 없었을 때도 마르코가 음식을 나눠줬어요!","source_cn":"我和扭耳都不擅长打猎……没有猎物的时候，也是马尔科把他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363DE5A2D4ECE7B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521352009:1":{"text":"저희를 대신해서 두 분의 소식을 알아봐준 것도 마르코였다고요... 위험을 무릅쓰고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님을 찾아가 저와 트위스트이어를 물안개 영지에서 빼내 준 것도 마르코였어요!","source_cn":"是马尔科帮我们向外界打探你和阿娘的消息……也是马尔科冒...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB25750441ABF18F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저희를 대신해서 두 분의 소식을 알아봐준 것도 마르코였다고요... 위험을 무릅쓰고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님을 찾아가 저와 트위스트이어를 물안개 영지에서 빼내 준 것도 마르코였어요!","female":"저희를 대신해서 두 분의 소식을 알아봐준 것도 마르코였다고요... 위험을 무릅쓰고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님을 찾아가 저와 트위스트이어를 물안개 영지에서 빼내 준 것도 마르코였어요!","variant_male_record_index":"183580","variant_female_record_index":"183581","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521352010:0":{"text":"그리고 그동안 저희는 진심으로 서로 사랑하게 되었어요...","source_cn":"那些日子的陪伴，我与他早已彼此相爱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E8F050A47227287","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521352011:0":{"text":"힘도, 종족도 상관없어요... 제가 사랑하는 건 바로 이 사람이에요!","source_cn":"与力量无关，与种族无关……我爱的就是他这个人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7DB81D192705135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521352012:0":{"text":"푸...","source_cn":"芙……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3449032AE68582B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521352013:0":{"text":"...나도 함께할게.","source_cn":"……我会和你一起承担。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41DE761A82E1A0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521352014:0":{"text":"제발 저를 믿어주세요. 저는 푸를 진심으로 사랑합니다! 허락하지 않으신다고 해도... 저는 모든 걸 걸고 푸와 함께하겠습니다.","source_cn":"请你们相信我，我对芙的爱是真的！即使你们不同意……我也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC5C2BC4A719D76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521352015:0":{"text":"아무리 반대하셔도, 목숨을 걸어야 한대도... 전 후회하지 않을 겁니다!","source_cn":"即使被你们教训，即使付出生命……我也绝不后悔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x056C8131778C8796","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521352016:0":{"text":"쳇...","source_cn":"哼……<key:dialog8>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C15E068BAA1CCCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521352017:0":{"text":"푸가 그렇게 고집한다면 너에게 기회를 한 번 주마. <style=\"highlight\">나를 쓰러뜨려라</style>!","source_cn":"既然芙这么坚持，那我就给你一次机会——<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB455F38C4E84BCBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521352018:1":{"text":"나를 이기기만 하면 더는 반대하지 않으마!","source_cn":"只要你能打败我，我和她阿娘就不再反对！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39798559FA6C083E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521352019:0":{"text":"...정말입니까?","source_cn":"……真的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF8FE8071126D83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521352020:0":{"text":"안 돼요! 마르코, 아직 다 낫지 않았잖아요!","source_cn":"不行！马尔科，你头上还有伤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42204D3E0FB16E63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521352021:0":{"text":"아니... 괜찮아.","source_cn":"不……没关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DE36DFFE4DF9E4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521352022:0":{"text":"너를 위해서라면 목숨을 바쳐도 상관없어.","source_cn":"我说了，为了你，付出生命也没关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC55B7E3D66DD43A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521352023:0":{"text":"반드시 이기겠습니다...!","source_cn":"来吧。我一定会打败你的……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72B8582AB050CDDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521352024:0":{"text":"그건 모르는 일이지.","source_cn":"哼，那可说不准！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x739D87A3FC25F1E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:颚":{"text":"자우","source":"颚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:马尔科":{"text":"마르코","source":"马尔科","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:芙":{"text":"푸","source":"芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}